  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the resnet50 image encoder with imagenet_vit_l in a multimodal multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation and concat fusion. Validation accuracy improved to 0.6287, suggesting the ViT encoder may enhance performance. However, the specific contribution of the image encoder remains uncertain without further comparison to other aggregation or fusion strategies."
